; FARO - lighthouse interior tileset (ground floor + Sala de la Lente) - GDD 8.1 'faro' set.
; Used through res/metatiles_faro.mt. Same VRAM slot as the exterior (BG 84.., base 84).
; LENS_00..22 = great lens unlit (3x3 metatiles); LENSLIT_00..22 = ring 1 lit (the M1b LAMP scene swaps
; the 9 cells LENS -> LENSLIT; later rings will need LENSLIT2..6 variants, same layout).
; 102 tiles. Generated from a script, then this file is the source of truth.

